 <h3><u>Khat-e-Sughra</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Khat-e-Sughra</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Haaye Sughra, Udaasi Ghar Mai Nauha Khwaan Thi</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Haaye Sughra, Shabihe Zehra Pareshaan Thi</p> <p>Haaye Sughra, Jab Yaad Sataane Lagi Ahl-o-Ayaal Ki</p> <p>Sughra Ne Ik Charaagh Jalakar, Baba Ko Khat Likha</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>(Watan Mai Chhorgaye, Apni Shahzadi Ko) x2</li>
    <p>Hamaare Baad Khushi Koi, Jab Manaaenge</p>
    <p>(Ay Baba Ham Bhi Tumhe Yaad Bohot Aayenge) x3</p>
    <li>Salaam Bheja Hai Sughra Ne, Bas Yehi Kehkar</li>
    <p>Na Maut Aayi Na Tum Aaye, Na Ali Akber</p>
    <p>Parinde Lout Ke Jab Bhi, Gharon Ko Jaaenge</p>
    <p>(Ay Baba Ham Bhi Tumhe Yaad Bohot Aaenge) x3</p>
    <li>Yeh Baap Beti Ki Ulfat Toh, Kam Nahin Hogi</li>
    <p>Dukhe Huwe Mere Iss Dil Ko, Hai Sukun Yehi</p>
    <p>Ghale Se Baali Sakina Ko, Jab Lagaaenge</p>
    <p>(Ay Baba Ham Bhi Tumhe Yaad Bohot Aaenge) x3</p>
    <li>Mera Shabihe Nabi Akber, Jab Azaa(n) Dega</li>
    <p>Zohr Ho Fajr Ho Maghrib Ho, Asr Ho Ke Isha</p>
    <p>Namaz Parhte Jo Daste, Dua Uthaayenge</p>
    <p>(Ay Baba Ham Bhi Tumhe Yaad Bohot Aaenge) x3</p>
    <li>Chalaa Tha Ghar Se Safar Ko Jo, Kaarwaa(n) Mera</li>
    <p>Humak ke Gowdi Me Aaya Tha, Bezubaa(n) Mera</p>
    <p>Jab aap Jhulaa Mere Bhai, Ka Julaaenge</p>
    <p>(Ay Baba Ham Bhi Tumhe Yaad Bohot Aaenge) x3</p>
    <li>Chacha Bhatiji Ki Ulfat Toh, Yaad Hai Baba</li>
    <p>Alam Ke Saaye Mai Rehti Thi, Fatema Sughra</p>
    <p>Mere Chacha Ka Alam Jab, Wahaa(n) Sajaaenge</p>
    <p>(Ay Baba Ham Bhi Tumhe Yaad Bohot Aaenge) x3</p>
    <li>Safar Pe Jaane Se Pehle Yeh, Baat Hoti Thi</li>
    <p>Ke Sab Se Pehle Dulhan Aaye, Ghar Mai Qasim Ki</p>
    <p>Jab aap Dasht Mai Dulha, Usse Banaaenge</p>
    <p>(Ay Baba Ham Bhi Tumhe Yaad Bohot Aaenge) x3</p>
    <li>Yeh Itminaan Mere Baba, Hai Mere Dil Ko</li>
    <p>Koi Kaniz Ho Kubra Ho, Ya Sakina Ho</p>
    <p>Kisi Ko Pyaar Se Jab Bhi, Ridaa Urhaaenge</p>
    <p>(Ay Baba Ham Bhi Tumhe Yaad Bohot Aaenge) x3</p>
    <li>Safar Mai Eid Jab Aayegi, Sayyed-e-Zeesha(n)</li>
    <p>Chacha Ho Aap Ho Akber Ho, Ya Phuphi Amma(n)</p>
    <p>Sakina Bibi Ko Jab, Baaliya(n) Penaaenge</p>
    <p>(Ay Baba Ham Bhi Tumhe Yaad Bohot Aaenge) x3</p>
    <li>Jo khat Mai Bayn The Sughra Ke, Mazhar-o-Irfa(n)</li>
   </ol> <p>Pisar Ki Laash Pe Parhte The, Sayyed-e-Zeesha(n)</p> <p>(Watan Mai Chhodgaye Apni Shahzadi Ko) x2</p> <p>Hamaare Baad Khushi Koi Jab Manaaenge</p> <p>(Ay Baba Ham Bhi Tumhe Yaad Bohot Aaenge) </p></font>
